#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_DepartmentStore_3F/scripts.inc:57
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_DepartmentStore_3F_Text_ItemsBestForTougheningPokemon"
msgid ""
"For quickly toughening up POKéMON,\n"
"items are the best.\p"
"PROTEIN boosts ATTACK,\n"
"and CALCIUM raises SP. ATK.$"
msgstr ""
"想让宝可梦快速变强，\n"
"道具是最好的选择。\p"
"攻击增强剂能提高攻击，\n"
"特攻增强剂能提高特攻。$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_DepartmentStore_3F/scripts.inc:63
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_DepartmentStore_3F_Text_WantMoreEndurance"
msgid ""
"I want my POKéMON to have more\n"
"endurance.\p"
"I'm trying to decide whether to raise\n"
"DEFENSE with IRON, or SP. DEF with ZINC.$"
msgstr ""
"我想让我的宝可梦\n"
"更耐打一些。\p"
"我在犹豫是用防御增强剂提高防御，\n"
"还是用特防增强剂提高特防。$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_DepartmentStore_3F/scripts.inc:69
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_DepartmentStore_3F_Text_GaveCarbosToSpeedUpMon"
msgid ""
"I gave a CARBOS to my POKéMON,\n"
"and its SPEED went up.$"
msgstr ""
"我给宝可梦用了速度增强剂，\n"
"它的速度就提高了。$"
